                                "example_id": "70cf640d-7cd9-4867-a738-7fe714bfb78d",
                                "sense_id": "23e8cba9-2393-3322-8151-213b3e1d8358",
                                "text": "FAIRY RADES: Another favored fairy activity is the rade, or ride, a procession of fairies on horseback. The fairy rade takes fairies into the land of the mortals. The most important rades occur on Midsummer Nght's Eve, the Summer Solstice, which occurs June 21 or 22."
